        <p style="font-family:var(--font-text);font-size:15px;color:var(--ink-2);line-height:1.6;margin:0 0 16px;max-width:460px;">Because Hana runs wire bond, flip chip and surface mount in the same group, a SiP is built without outsourcing any of its assembly steps.</p>
